  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">10년 전, 과학동화 만들기 활동 수행평가를 많이 했습니다.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">&#39;달리기를 하면 왜 심장박동이 빨리 뛰고, 호흡이 가빠질까&#39; 에 대해</span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">재미있는 과학동화(만화)로 만드는 활동입니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c3b2f6348fd611a209a6bc2a20a3ff2ad96622a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"766\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0c3b2f6348fd611a209a6bc2a20a3ff2ad96622a\" data-origin-width=\"956\" data-origin-height=\"478\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">이 결과물에 대해 아래와 같은 채점기준으로 평가를 하였습니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f91271abaae47a8a3db87618e56bb5ecab760840\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"213\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f91271abaae47a8a3db87618e56bb5ecab760840\" data-origin-width=\"694\" data-origin-height=\"296\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">&#160;</span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">최근 여러 교과에서 &#39;AI동화 만들기&#39; 활동을 하네요.</span><br><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">1. 동화 내용을 만들 때 저는 대한민국 모든 국민이 사용하는 카카오톡의</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">&#160; &#160;&#39;AskUp&#39;을 사용합니다.</span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e1caa24acdd7100e62ba4340d9e549210d6d1d1a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e1caa24acdd7100e62ba4340d9e549210d6d1d1a\" data-origin-width=\"295\" data-origin-height=\"489\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b57dc3de5c25f9dceabfe812cac72bf4a41955c4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b57dc3de5c25f9dceabfe812cac72bf4a41955c4\" data-origin-width=\"632\" data-origin-height=\"726\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3bc4b57c7f08896e51bb566c200e503d1c084493\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3bc4b57c7f08896e51bb566c200e503d1c084493\" data-origin-width=\"665\" data-origin-height=\"993\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">2. 선생님들도 &#39;AskUp&#39;을 활용하여 원하는 과학동화를 만들어보세요.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">&#160; &#160;과학동화의 완성도를 높이기 위해 어떤 프롬프트들을 넣으셨나요?</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f23ff4c48dacbb9ec6049aa9d015217a602cbda1\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"172\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f23ff4c48dacbb9ec6049aa9d015217a602cbda1\" data-origin-width=\"1028\" data-origin-height=\"353\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">3. 탐구문제 : AI가 작성해준 과학동화를 평가한다면 어떤 채점기준이 필요할까요?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">&#160; 1) 채점기준 1 :</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">&#160; 2) 채점기준 2 :</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">4. 아래의 내용은 2024~2025 년도</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">&#160; &#160;경남과학교사, 울산과학교사, 광주과학교사, 과학1정,&#160; 단위 학교 연수, 과학교육학회 워크숍 등에서</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">&#160;선생님들과 연구자 분들이 논의해주신 평가기준입니다.</span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 305px;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 155px;\"><td style=\"width: 33.3333%; height: 155px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/200ec2c1dfe58b83ce72d1ffe32b5b9fd609acc0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/200ec2c1dfe58b83ce72d1ffe32b5b9fd609acc0\" data-origin-width=\"317\" data-origin-height=\"181\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.3333%; height: 155px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ab2de5d3095e39583f949705c92a58359aa714a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7ab2de5d3095e39583f949705c92a58359aa714a\" data-origin-width=\"322\" data-origin-height=\"130\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.3333%; height: 155px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cacdae3b55d1b22e591fc8d9c2ccd4b0eaa857a0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cacdae3b55d1b22e591fc8d9c2ccd4b0eaa857a0\" data-origin-width=\"304\" data-origin-height=\"125\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 150px;\"><td style=\"width: 33.3333%; height: 150px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5b38fe069c59e55f19c5a09a040525cfedb4b75e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5b38fe069c59e55f19c5a09a040525cfedb4b75e\" data-origin-width=\"306\" data-origin-height=\"132\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.3333%; height: 150px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">-&#160;프롬프트를&#160;구체적으로&#160;작성했는가?<br>&#160;(과학적 개념 및 적용)&#160;</span></td><td style=\"width: 33.3333%; height: 150px;\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\"><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">&#160;Q1) 위 논의들을 설펴볼 때 어떤 평가기준이 포함되어야 할까요?</span></b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">&#160;5. 아래의 내용은 &#39;달리기를 하면 심장박동이 더 빨라지는 이유&#39; 를 AI과학동화로 만드는 과정입니다.</span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f48c2da3ee89663452911102d9e2c18eea564ac\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f48c2da3ee89663452911102d9e2c18eea564ac\" data-origin-width=\"427\" data-origin-height=\"397\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/596d21e799a41976d3d74381498772979ebf8776\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/596d21e799a41976d3d74381498772979ebf8776\" data-origin-width=\"411\" data-origin-height=\"462\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.3333%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/638c13a23c99d0e4634596ef57b702cce48e3441\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/638c13a23c99d0e4634596ef57b702cce48e3441\" data-origin-width=\"417\" data-origin-height=\"420\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\"><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">&#160;Q2) 위 자료를 설펴볼 때 어떤 평가기준이 포함되어야 할까요?</span></b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">6.&#160; 이 게시물(1~5번)의 내용을 pdf 파일로 만들어 AI와 대화를 나눕니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/525d1373935534abc657c30c9670ba0ed3c4ad88\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"396\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/525d1373935534abc657c30c9670ba0ed3c4ad88\" data-origin-width=\"921\" data-origin-height=\"201\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">7. 프롬프트와 관련 평가 항목을 만들어 달라고 요청합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1b693e8e5ecc6b3cc8c536b6e30eaf17ebeec8a4\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" height=\"77\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1b693e8e5ecc6b3cc8c536b6e30eaf17ebeec8a4\" data-origin-width=\"699\" data-origin-height=\"108\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">8. 4가지의 평가항목을 만들어줍니다.&#160;</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b536a5c1b62c7beef9da3a191bb4b3204e8e7053\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"221\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b536a5c1b62c7beef9da3a191bb4b3204e8e7053\" data-origin-width=\"899\" data-origin-height=\"331\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a6ca18e167b6301def96683a9508a2ed43dbe60\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"234\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a6ca18e167b6301def96683a9508a2ed43dbe60\" data-origin-width=\"907\" data-origin-height=\"354\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e19ac5ce1d8bc1f2e2b919eef73d24167100ab62\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"186\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e19ac5ce1d8bc1f2e2b919eef73d24167100ab62\" data-origin-width=\"907\" data-origin-height=\"281\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ad13821df46de842f3a7c9199c3fa7417970580\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"195\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9ad13821df46de842f3a7c9199c3fa7417970580\" data-origin-width=\"903\" data-origin-height=\"294\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">9. 채점 루브릭을 만들어달라고 요청합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/804a9cf01be9309e170b43a002e2c87ddbe98bf8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"418\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/804a9cf01be9309e170b43a002e2c87ddbe98bf8\" data-origin-width=\"905\" data-origin-height=\"631\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">10. 특히 &#39;프롬프트&#39; 평가의 관점에서 채점 루브릭을 요청합니다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fa6d474466d976f88a59d4774aba25f006049c4\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"369\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fa6d474466d976f88a59d4774aba25f006049c4\" data-origin-width=\"910\" data-origin-height=\"559\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/001318a2ef1e1a3a96fa2a0bacbd69cba26d11e0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" height=\"136\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/001318a2ef1e1a3a96fa2a0bacbd69cba26d11e0\" data-origin-width=\"901\" data-origin-height=\"204\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">11. 해당 평가기준을 &#39;학생용 평가 안내자료&#39;로 만들어 보았습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/284\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">&#160; &#160; &#160;https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/284</a>&#160; 참고</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>(탐구 소감 및 시사점)</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>1. AI와 대화를 하면서 동료교사 같다는 생각을 합니다.</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>&#160; &#160;더 나아가 저의 평가계획을 컨설팅 해주시는 000수석선생님을 만난 느낌입니다!</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>2. 새학기 평가계획 세울 때 기존의 평가계획을 그대로 복붙하지 않고,</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>&#160; &#160;제가 상상하고 도전하고 싶은 새로운 수업&amp;평가 계획을 만드는데 용기가 생겼습니다!&#160; &#160;</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>결론 : 그래서 AI는 교사의 상상을 실현하는 플랫폼입니다!</b></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
